  "body": "A beautifully finished standalone residence, offering the commitment to contemporary design, quality and comfortable modern living. A wonderful opportunity to secure a brand-new home in this sought-after coastal neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover light-filled living spaces, stylish kitchens, quality finishes and seamless connections to outdoor entertaining. Whether enjoying time with family, hosting friends or simply relaxing at home, these properties have been designed to make everyday living feel effortless.\r\n\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms(including 2 ensuite) with a study\r\n* Contemporary kitchen with quality finishes plus Butlers Pantry - electric and gas hob\r\n* Spacious open-plan living /dining\r\n* Elevated master suite with walk-in wardrobe and fabulous ensuite\r\n* Beautiful sea views across to Rangitoto Island\r\n* Double internal-access garaging and separate laundry\r\n* 10 year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and here you can enjoy the very best of the Browns Bay lifestyle. Stroll to the beautiful beach, enjoy the village cafés and restaurants, browse the local shops or make the most of the excellent everyday amenities nearby.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the choice of highly regarded schools, including Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nBrand-new quality, impressive design and a superb coastal setting make these homes an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange your private viewing. Short-notice appointments welcome.",
